The icon drawings in default.json come from Lucide (https://lucide.dev), or are redrawn from Lucide designs,
and are used under its ISC licence. Some Lucide icons derive from Feather and carry the MIT licence below it.
The diagram-type icons (including type-usecase), the flowchart shape tiles, the participant-kind glyphs, the use case diagram glyphs
(actor, usecase, subject, hash) and a few toolbar icons (including present) were drawn for this skill and are released with it. The clock and search icons
are redrawn from the Lucide designs of the same name.

